EBOOK_READER|
  calibre_library=~/.TheIgors/akien/onedrive/AkiensMedia/Ebooks/Calibre Portable/Calibre Library
  formats=epub,mobi,azw,pdf,web|tokenization=nltk sentences
  stale_handle=_local_copy() copies to /tmp before read (handles CIFS drops)
  state=reading_state.json
  damasio_books=ids 3023,3300,3032,3025,3026

LEARNER|
  entry=learn_about(user_input) — strips trigger, searches Calibre (non-fiction filter), browser AI discovery
  tonight=detected from input → queues Calibre books too; nothing launches immediately
  local=all background launches use --local (Ollama qwen2.5:7b, free)
  queue=~/.TheIgors/learn_queue.json|calibre://ID sentinel for Calibre books|URLs for web sources
  drain_manual=process_learn_queue(max_items=5) — 3s human pace between launches
  drain_background=drain_learn_queue() → spawns claudecode/drain_learn_queue.py (PID-guarded, 60s between, loops until empty)
  auto_drain=learn_about() calls _launch_queue_runner() whenever items queued
  caching=book_learner adds cache_control:ephemeral to system prompt for Claude models via OR
  book_learner=claudecode/book_learner.py --calibre-id|--url|--local|--run|--resume
  drain_runner=claudecode/drain_learn_queue.py --delay SECS|PID=~/.TheIgors/drain_learn_queue.pid

BROWSER|
  lib=browser-use 0.12.2 in venv (upgraded 2026-03-14g from 0.11.9; fixes integer-minimum schema rejection)
  llm=gpt-4o-mini via OR (D063); BROWSER_USE_MODEL env var overrides
  display=real display while debugging (DISPLAY set → skip Xvfb); headless=Xvfb when DISPLAY unset
  log=~/.TheIgors/logs/browser_use.log; start/complete/error logged at INFO level
  discovery=_discover_urls_via_browser() logs errors; status+URL count logged; _extract_topic() uses find() not startswith()
  check_claude_balance=scrapes console.anthropic.com/settings/billing using employer Chrome profile; parses balance; writes {balance_usd,fetched_at} to ~/.TheIgors/cc_channel/anthropic_balance.json; trust gate=repl/web only; added 2026-03-15h (D088)

